Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

3 positives (red until §3.9): captures clause with ctor demand + method/prop
scope coverage; the §2.1.3 interface-conformance adapter story; struct captures
with copy. 3 negatives: construction without capability; primary-ctor ban
(author ruling, forward-compatible with Modal); subclass isolation (rule 5).
Pre-Modal semantics per author ruling: all ctors capture, all bodies covered,
no escape checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
